{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><math alttext=\"2 r equals 9 s plus t\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The given equation relates the variables <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math>, <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math>, and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>. Which equation correctly expresses <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>?</p>", "keys": ["5e2a5c79-92a4-47d6-a494-3223f20efa59"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "7519ae16-367f-4a9e-9bd4-303acbc32560", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"s equals two ninths r minus t\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p>"}, {"id": "5e2a5c79-92a4-47d6-a494-3223f20efa59", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"s equals StartFraction 2 r minus t Over 9 EndFraction\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math></p>"}, {"id": "c34931b2-4588-4b49-a7ea-0c55de4f7fbd", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"s equals 18 r minus t\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p>"}, {"id": "38543197-06b5-47e9-bf54-787a38aaf9a3", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"s equals 9 left parenthesis 2 r minus t right parenthesis\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B is correct. Subtracting <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math> from each side of the given equation yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2 r minus t equals 9 s\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>s</mi></math>. Dividing each side of this equation by <math alttext=\"9\"><mn>9</mn>\n</math> yields&nbsp;<math alttext=\"StartFraction 2 r minus t Over 9 EndFraction equals s\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi></math>, which can be rewritten as <math alttext=\"s equals StartFraction 2 r minus t Over 9 EndFraction\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the equation&nbsp;<math alttext=\"s equals StartFraction 2 r minus t Over 9 EndFraction\"><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math> correctly expresses <math alttext=\"s\"><mi>s</mi>\n</math> in terms of <math alttext=\"r\"><mi>r</mi>\n</math> and <math alttext=\"t\"><mi>t</mi>\n</math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"2 r equals 9 left parenthesis s plus t right parenthesis\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, not&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2 r equals 9 s plus t\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"2 r equals StartFraction s plus t Over 9 EndFraction\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow><mn>9</mn></mfrac></math>, not&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2 r equals 9 s plus t\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect. This equation is equivalent to <math alttext=\"2 r equals StartFraction s Over 9 EndFraction plus t\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>s</mi><mn>9</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>, not&nbsp;<math alttext=\"2 r equals 9 s plus t\"><mn>2</mn><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>s</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>t</mi></math>.</p>", "externalid": "29c9eada-06c0-4ac4-846d-366083f6cf03", "correct_answer": ["B"]}